From d29f929d6a2df7d2df65a9dd72589dd3520baaa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tendai Makumire <121951760+tmakumire@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Apr 2025 14:13:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for AR1335 into CHI-CDK for SBC8550 (#41)

* Add support for AR1335 into CHI-CDK
Added AR1335 sensor driver XML and
exposure driver. Exposure driver
uses gain table copied from the
datasheet.

* Added 1920x1080 60FPS stream config for AR1335

---------

Co-authored-by: dev <dev@imd-tec.com>
